StringTable InfoToolsCrafted
{
	Entry _strings
	[
		{
			String _name = "ToolsCrafted";
			String _text = "Tools & Utensils";
		}
		{
			String _name = "Title1";
			String _text = "Tools, Crafted goods & Utensils";
		}
		{
			String _name = "Title2";
			String _text = "- of the tools and utensils, either those used by all citizens or by the skilled -";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text01";
			String _text = "Tools play a very important role in helping to make a prosperous town. Tools; that is of the kind used by all citizens (Bronze Tools, Iron Tools, Steel Tools etc), are necessary for economical and practical needs. Used for undertaking the most essential of tasks: wood chopping, clearing, sowing and harvesting of fields, mining, blacksmithing, they all require the use of tools.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text02";
			String _text = "A task, or building is given a work time number, this is the unit of time spent to undertake the task and complete the cycle/production. But along with this is a work required number, this number represents the actual physical amount of work required for each cycle. And it is this number that directly influences, and is influenced by Tools.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text03";
			String _text = "On the right you will see the list of tools available, under the name of each tool is the symbol:";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text04";
			String _text = "This symbol, and the number next to it, represent the quality of the tool and the number of work units it is capable of achieving before 'breaking'.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text05";
			String _text = "Not only is a citizen who is without a tool likely to be very slow in the production of goods, they will also be hampered in the collecting & harvesting of foods, felling trees and chopping firewood. The construction of buildings is also seriously hampered if a builder does not have a tool.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text06";
			String _text = "Changes in the game with DS mods active, have made the production of Iron no longer as simple as collecting it from the surface, or having a mine easily produce it with limited cost involved.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text07";
			String _text = "an overview of changes:";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text08";
			String _text = "-Native Iron is no longer available from the surface of the map, instead there are small quantities of Iron Ore, Copper Ore and Tin Ore found across the landscape.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text08a";
			String _text = "-Copper and Tin Ore are the more prevalent ores found upon the surface. Iron Ore is found in smaller quantities.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text09";
			String _text = "-Mines will only produce ores (as well as coal) instead of the native metals (iron, copper, etc).";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text09a";
			String _text = "-Mining production will now have a cost of either Logs or Timber and Lamp Oil or Candles.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text10";
			String _text = "-Iron Ore will need to be smelted in a furnace with a Metallurgical Fuel (Coke or Charcoal) to produce Iron. The same for Copper and other metals and alloys.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text10a";
			String _text = "-Production of Coke comes from the mining and 'cooking' of Coal. Charcoal comes from the char-burning of Logs.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text10b";
			String _text = "-The introduction of Copper Ore upon the surface allows the production of a simple to produce early game tool, a Copper Tool can be smelted only using firewood (see list on right).";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text10c";
			String _text = "-Producing higher quality tools that need further forging for strength (steel & hardened tools) will require the use of a metallurgical fuel.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text11a";
			String _text = "Tools can be further processed and sharpened to become 'fine' versions of themselves at a Grindstone. These tools are denoted by an asterisk (*) after their name. These tools will have a better durability of 25 work units compared to their normal versions.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text11b";
			String _text = "If they are also processed and 'oiled', with the use of Linseed Oil, these tools will benefit from an increased durability of 50 work units. These tools are denoted by an asterisk and a circumflex (*^) after their name.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text12";
			String _text = "There are other types of tools, being of the crafted goods & utensils variety; they are used by various professions, for either production of goods, or in the construction of buildings.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text13a";
			String _text = "Tools:Stonemason";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text13b";
			String _text = "Required as a production cost to extract stone from quarries, the introduction of Tools:Stonemason has also reduced the high risk and likelihood of occupational death that Stonecutters were faced with. Also used as a construction cost in some larger stone buildings.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text14a";
			String _text = "Tools:Fisherman";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text14b";
			String _text = "Required as a construction cost to build fishing locations, these were previously called Fishing Gear in earlier DS mods.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text15a";
			String _text = "Tools:Hunter";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text15b";
			String _text = "Required as a construction cost to build hunting locations, these were previously called Hunting Gear in earlier DS mods.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text16a";
			String _text = "Gathering Basket";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text16b";
			String _text = "Required as a construction cost to build gathering locations, as well as a production cost for the collection of Acorns.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text17";
			String _text = "Further to those above, the following crafted goods play important roles in mining, construction and tool improvements:";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text17a";
			String _text = "Lamp Oil";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text17b";
			String _text = "Used as a production cost to extract ores & minerals from mines, also used in the construction cost of building Tunnels.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text18a";
			String _text = "Candles";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text18b";
			String _text = "Used as a production cost to extract ores & minerals from mines, also used in the construction cost of building Tunnels and places of worship.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text19a";
			String _text = "Linseed Oil";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column1text19b";
			String _text = "Used at a grindstone to improve the work units of new tools, Linseed Oil increases the durability of the handle. Along with the 25 work units gained from sharpening the tool, it gains an extra 25 when this added process is also performed.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column2MadeFrom";
			String _text = "is made from:";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column2MadeFromEither";
			String _text = "one of either of these";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column2MadeFromEitherAnd";
			String _text = "and using:";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column2MadeFromOr";
			String _text = "or:";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column2ToolsTITLE";
			String _text = "Tools (used by all citizens):";
		}
		{
			String _name = "column2CraftedTITLE";
			String _text = "Crafted Goods & Utensils:";
		}
		{
